{"text": "Ani has a pen friend in London. Her name is Emily, and she is eleven, like Ani. Every month they write letters to each other in English. Today Ani writes about her school, her favourite food and the mountains near Yerevan. She draws a small picture of Mount Ararat at the bottom of the page. Then she puts the letter in an envelope and walks to the post office with her dad. 'I hope Emily writes back soon,' she says.", "words": [[0.48, 0.78], [0.9, 1.04], [1.1, 1.13], [1.26, 1.54], [1.72, 2.16], [2.56, 2.66], [2.74, 3.18], [4.64, 4.74], [4.82, 5.12], [5.2, 5.3], [5.48, 5.82], [6.32, 6.42], [6.5, 6.58], [6.68, 6.76], [6.84, 7.36], [7.62, 7.86], [7.98, 8.26], [9.74, 10.0], [10.1, 10.42], [10.74, 10.88], [10.96, 11.3], [11.44, 11.8], [11.86, 11.94], [12.08, 12.28], [12.34, 12.56], [12.96, 13.06], [13.16, 13.62], [15.02, 15.36], [15.56, 15.82], [15.94, 16.3], [16.36, 16.64], [16.68, 16.78], [16.88, 17.3], [17.84, 17.94], [18.06, 18.54], [18.62, 19.06], [19.5, 19.58], [19.6, 19.68], [19.72, 20.4], [20.56, 20.72], [20.8, 21.46], [22.86, 22.96], [23.04, 23.46], [23.56, 23.59], [23.72, 24.06], [24.18, 24.6], [24.7, 24.78], [24.88, 25.14], [25.3, 25.78], [26.24, 26.32], [26.36, 26.44], [26.52, 26.88], [26.96, 27.04], [27.1, 27.18], [27.28, 27.82], [29.18, 29.36], [29.44, 29.54], [29.64, 29.88], [29.92, 30.0], [30.08, 30.36], [30.62, 30.68], [30.72, 30.8], [30.94, 31.52], [31.98, 32.1], [32.16, 32.48], [32.56, 32.62], [32.66, 32.76], [32.84, 33.22], [33.32, 33.72], [33.84, 33.96], [34.02, 34.14], [34.26, 34.68], [34.9, 36.12], [36.22, 36.42], [36.56, 36.86], [36.98, 37.34], [37.4, 37.64], [37.74, 38.46], [38.48, 38.58], [38.68, 39.214]], "tag": "kokoro:bm_george", "pace": "v2-slow", "fx": "pb1", "aligned": "ctc1", "clamped": 1}